:SUB.B SRCB3, gRB is (eamode=0xf & eaw=0) ... & SRCB3; g5=0x06 & gRB { local src:1 = SRCB3; subflags(gRB, src); gRB = gRB - src; setNZ(gRB); }
:SUB.B SRCB3, gRB is ealo=0x15 ... & SRCB3; g5=0x06 & gRB { local src:1 = SRCB3; subflags(gRB, src); gRB = gRB - src; setNZ(gRB); }
